# (the desktop's importers and Android's bookmarks file), tracking parameters, the text helpers
# element hiding uses, spaces and their saved tabs (Local State lb.spaces, lb.space_tabs), tab names and pinned
# links, command matching, the search engine choice on Chromium's engines, and the release
# version the About page and chrome://version show (desktop/patches/lb/release-version-ui.patch,
# android/patches/release-version.patch). Unit tested by lb_unittests.
